    "detailed_description": "<strong>Heralds of Silence</strong> is a first-person horror game. Solve complex puzzles, look for clues, dive into the darkness of empty corridors and, perhaps, you will discover the secrets of a mysterious scientific complex and the curse of the Silence.<br><br><u>Average time to complete the game: 90 minutes</u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story</h2><strong>Heralds of Silence </strong>is a huge World with rich history and plenty events and characters. This is a only first chpter in long story. Step by step, unravel the story of a sinister scientific complex where human experiments are carried out in the hope of deriving humanity to new heights. But will they succeed or will they release a new plague into this world?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characters</h2>Emma, a third-year medical student, lives with her parents and a dog named Chucky, a completely ordinary girl, no different from her peers, except that she was kidnapped a few days ago. And, seems, she can't speak. And this is her story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>Wander through the dark corridors of the scientific complex, get scared, solve difficult puzzles, concentrate and look around. It won't be easy.",
